// Owning domain : Identity (chora_identity database)
// Owning team   : Team 3 (Platform)
// Topic prefix  : chora.identity.user_mana.*
//
// Mana is the 4th currency — real-money-backed prepaid credit, GCID-scoped,
// non-tenant-transferable, persists across subscription cancellations.
// DISTINCT from in-platform Three-Currency (XP/Coins/StarCredits/Reputation
// = community engagement loops). No exchange between mana and the
// engagement currencies.
//
// All mana mutations append a row to the `mana_ledger` (append-only,
// month-partitioned). These events mirror those ledger entries one-for-one;
// idempotency_key in the envelope MUST equal the ledger entry_id for
// deterministic replay.
//
// EVERY event message embeds chora.common.v1.EventEnvelope as field 1.
